# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
/coverage

# next.js
/.next/
/out/

# production
/build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# keep the example env
!.env.example

# local code intelligence index
.codegraph/

# local pnpm store (accidentally committed)
.pnpm-home/

# editor settings (local preference, not project config)
.vscode/

# 工具产物目录（本机生成的图表/助手缓存，不属于源码）
# 理由：.archify/ 有 299 个文件、约 12.8 万行，.workbuddy-ai/ 同理，
# 一旦被 git add -A 卷进版本库，会让每次 diff/评审被生成物淹没，
# 而它们随时可以从各自的工具重新生成，没有版本价值。
.archify/
.workbuddy-ai/
